{"title":"Deer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"berries\" title=\"Berries - in 100% of 3 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 9 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d942317ed6a8f10b2d65.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Berries</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 3/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"venison\" title=\"Venison - in 100% of 3 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 6 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d9348f1e6eaf331348c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Venison</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 3/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deer-hide\" title=\"Deer Hide - in 67% of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 3 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3fa9e156c59310be536f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deer Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 2/3</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"